[I] Qt for Python - Binding generation

[T] shiboken6-generator is the binding generator for Qt For Python, which is
[T] the Python Qt bindings project, providing access to the complete Qt
[T] framework as well as to generator tools for rapidly generating bindings for
[T] any C++ libraries.

